WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.048 --> 00:00:07.415
Before you start: requester and disposable shared ticket (customer native screens)

2
00:00:07.415 --> 00:00:14.556
1. Shared IT teams message with an attached file (QA)

3
00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:18.289
1. Customer reads the shared message and file

4
00:00:18.289 --> 00:00:42.506
1. Organization-private messages from each side, then requester audience

5
00:00:42.506 --> 00:00:46.358
1. Requester sees only requester-audience content in the portal

6
00:00:46.358 --> 00:01:00.996
2. Author removes a disposable attachment; old link stops downloading

7
00:01:00.996 --> 00:01:13.400
2. Uncertain send: server saved the message but the response was lost

8
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:47.906
3. Reply from the other organization, edit, and delete the root

9
00:01:47.906 --> 00:02:10.795
4. Whole-thread audience change: MSP-private thread with reply and file

10
00:02:10.795 --> 00:02:25.044
4. Restrict the disclosed thread back to Shared IT teams

11
00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:52.578
5. Requester task conversation (portal) on a requester-visible shared task

12
00:02:52.578 --> 00:02:56.910
5. Cleanup: customer removes the requester project grant
